  m_text: '4



    Searching by catagory is the fastest way to get started.


    Follow
    the menu buttons, or use the search bar to chose a model to download.


    ---


    Searching
    by planet provides a 3D representation of all spatially located models for that
    particular planet. The planet can be moved, rotated and rescaled using tap gestures.


    Tapping
    on the planet at a particular location brings up an icon that allows you to go
    to that point.


    A contextural map will appear with any models within that
    region highlighted. You can tap on the model names to recenter the map, or download
    the model.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
